1 0 obj<</Author(MalachiWalker)/CreationDate(D:20261101021513+00'00')/Creator(calibre \(9.17.0\) [https://calibre-ebook.com])/Keywords(Fanworks, Mature, She-Ra and the Princesses of Power \(2018\), Adora/Catra \(She-Ra\), Catra \(She-Ra\), Adora \(She-Ra\), Shadow Weaver | Light Spinner \(She-Ra\), We're in the fright zone now so you know what that means:, Shadow Weaver's A+ Parenting, I give Catra a happy childhood for five seconds just to take it away, Because needs be and I'm a MONSTER, Original Magicat characters because canon hasn't given us any yet, And the 80s show had all of four, And they all had stupid names, Tao is named after one but he's basically an OC, Pretty graphic depiction of a car wreck, Catra grapples with her canon self's PTSD transcending universes, As if she didn't have enough to deal with, Coping with emotional trauma by getting really hardcore about your hobby, Just like an anime character, How many times will I recreate The Promise?, AS MANY TIMES AS I NEED UNTIL IT STOPS HURTING, F/F, Graphic Depictions Of Violence, Now rated M for Shadow Weaver being Shadow Weaver, i.e. a child torturing MONSTER, Adora's lack of chill makes its first appearence, Catra and Adora have a mutual protective streak and it causes PROBLEMS, Chapter two has hurt/comfort like wow, Unsubtle racists getting their comeuppance, Man all of these kids have steel in their spines and snark in their hearts, Oh crap the hurt/comfort came back for the finale, Found family for the win, Kyle/Rogelio \(She-Ra\) \(side\), Kyle \(She-Ra\), Lonnie \(She-Ra\), Rogelio \(She-Ra\), "NOT A STANDALONE FIC")/ModDate(D:20261101021513+00'00')/Producer(calibre \(9.17.0\) [https://calibre-ebook.com])/Title(Let's Take A Sentimental Journey \(Don't Forget To Bleed\))>>
endobj
